      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T07:56:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because we need to maintain two flow (sync and async state machine) for a while. And async state machine use State.\n\nThus, let SyncState extend State would be more easy to deal with the two flows:\n\n    class MyState extends SyncState {\n        // Existing StateMachine would call enter here. \n        @Override\n        public void enter() {\n            enter(lastResult);\n        }\n        @Override\n        public int enter(final int lastResult) {\n            // Implement MyState#enter here for SyncStateMachine\n        }\n        ...\n    }\n\nRemove the override implementation, it is more suitable to put in StateMachineShim in followup change.",
      "parentUuid": "ca735609_b4710e09",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 42,
