      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually the caller who create SyncStateMachine is a binder thread calling from system server, it create tethering object and SyncStateMachine first then start the tethering thread. After that everything would run in the same thread. Change Looper to Thread.\n\nFor the thread safety, all the variable initialize in constructor is final. Non-final variable would only be touch from same thread passing from constructor.",
